sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 客户端
    participant Handler as UserHandler
    participant Service as UserService
    participant EventLoop as Event Loop<br/>(Reactor)
    participant BlockingPool as Blocking Pool<br/>(boundedElastic)
    participant Mapper as MyBatis Mapper
    participant MySQL as MySQL 8.x
    
    Note over Client,MySQL: 响应式请求处理流程
    
    Client->>Handler: HTTP请求<br/>GET /api/v1/users/123
    activate Handler
    
    Handler->>Service: getUserById(123L)
    Note right of Handler: 返回Mono<User><br/>非阻塞
    
    activate Service
    Service->>EventLoop: subscribeOn(Schedulers.boundedElastic())
    Note right of Service: 调度到阻塞线程池
    
    EventLoop->>BlockingPool: 调度JDBC操作
    activate BlockingPool
    
    BlockingPool->>Mapper: selectById(123L)
    activate Mapper
    Note right of BlockingPool: JDBC阻塞操作<br/>隔离在专用线程池
    
    Mapper->>MySQL: SELECT * FROM sys_user<br/>WHERE id = 123
    activate MySQL
    MySQL-->>Mapper: 返回结果集
    deactivate MySQL
    
    Mapper-->>BlockingPool: User对象
    deactivate Mapper
    
    BlockingPool-->>EventLoop: 发射数据到Reactor
    deactivate BlockingPool
    
    EventLoop-->>Service: Mono<User>
    deactivate Service
    
    Service-->>Handler: map/flatMap转换
    Note left of Service: 响应式操作符<br/>在Event Loop执行
    
    Handler-->>Client: ServerResponse<br/>200 OK + JSON
    deactivate Handler
    
    Note over Client,MySQL: 线程模型说明
    Note over EventLoop: Event Loop线程数: CPU核心数<br/>处理轻量级操作(map/filter)
    Note over BlockingPool: Blocking Pool线程数: 32(可配置)<br/>隔离阻塞I/O操作(JDBC/Redis)
